(4514048, 650383, 74017, '<td valign="top">nice shot  but the editing is to harsh there are way to many jagged edges  i think you would have had a better photo if you didn''t try to take out the background and just cropped the image closer.  nice try all the same</td>', 'nice shot  but the editing is to harsh there are way to many jagged edges  i think you would have had a better photo if you didn''t try to take out the background and just cropped the image closer.  nice try all the same', '2008-02-25 08:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
