(4514050, 650077, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s a hoot :-)))  His eyes look bored, though.  Maybe a little dodge and burn to perk them up?  With the stark background I''d also use a little more light from one side or the other to make him look more 3-dimensional.  Really great pose, though.</td>', 'That''s a hoot :-)))  His eyes look bored, though.  Maybe a little dodge and burn to perk them up?  With the stark background I''d also use a little more light from one side or the other to make him look more 3-dimensional.  Really great pose, though.', '2008-02-25 08:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4514051, 649901, 86447, '<td valign="top">The black in the shadows hides too much detail for me to really like this.  The processing is pleasing, though.</td>', 'The black in the shadows hides too much detail for me to really like this.  The processing is pleasing, though.', '2008-02-25 08:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
