(4514122, 649002, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful face; she looks very, very sweet.  DOF, pose and crop are great.  Overall nice job on the lighting; nit - the bright catchlights in her eyes don''t match in placement or brightness or softness, and there is a faint catchlight in the pupil on the right which gives it roundness not present in the other pupil.  It took me a sec to realize what was bugging me about the eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful face; she looks very, very sweet.  DOF, pose and crop are great.  Overall nice job on the lighting; nit - the bright catchlights in her eyes don''t match in placement or brightness or softness, and there is a faint catchlight in the pupil on the right which gives it roundness not present in the other pupil.  It took me a sec to realize what was bugging me about the eyes.', '2008-02-25 08:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
