(4514952, 650806, 51793, '<td valign="top">The light from the windows on the bed is a bit distracting and makes me want to look there. I think by taking that out of the mix and maybe adding some contrast would really bring this to life. Also when shooting just about the whole subject very rarely do you want to chop off something as small as a couple of toe nails. You should watch that in the future.</td>', 'The light from the windows on the bed is a bit distracting and makes me want to look there. I think by taking that out of the mix and maybe adding some contrast would really bring this to life. Also when shooting just about the whole subject very rarely do you want to chop off something as small as a couple of toe nails. You should watch that in the future.', '2008-02-25 12:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
