(4514957, 650661, 51793, '<td valign="top">Just another day at the office,How cute. Good job with setting up the dog but watch the shadows on the back side. A small fill light would have been very useful here.</td>', 'Just another day at the office,How cute. Good job with setting up the dog but watch the shadows on the back side. A small fill light would have been very useful here.', '2008-02-25 12:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
