(4515313, 649005, 88878, '<td valign="top">This is really cute!  Don''t know how well it will score next to the other portraits where you can see it, but I think this one is so much better than a lot I have seen.  It is definetly a very acurate image of exactly what cats do! well done!</td>', 'This is really cute!  Don''t know how well it will score next to the other portraits where you can see it, but I think this one is so much better than a lot I have seen.  It is definetly a very acurate image of exactly what cats do! well done!', '2008-02-25 14:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515317, 650669, 88878, '<td valign="top">Ha!! he''s been swimming! What a great shot of a dog doing what they do best, getting dirty!!  The look on his face is priceless!</td>', 'Ha!! he''s been swimming! What a great shot of a dog doing what they do best, getting dirty!!  The look on his face is priceless!', '2008-02-25 14:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
