(4515327, 650715, 88878, '<td valign="top">Is this your dog? I really hope not, I''m no PETA fanatic but I certainly don''t like seeing a dog being chained up with her pups to care for.<br/> <br/>That being said, this is a wonderful shot! I understand that art/photography isn''t always beautiful and picture perfect and this is a very powerful image.  I love the xpression on her face and the composition is perfect.  Well done on the shot!<br/> <br/>If it is your dog, please take it inside, or atleast give it a collar that fits and use a rope or yard tie instead of a heavy chain to tie her up. I''m sure she''s tired enough with about 4 pups to raise......</td>', 'Is this your dog? I really hope not, I''m no PETA fanatic but I certainly don''t like seeing a dog being chained up with her pups to care for. That being said, this is a wonderful shot! I understand that art/photography isn''t always beautiful and picture perfect and this is a very powerful image.  I love the xpression on her face and the composition is perfect.  Well done on the shot! If it is your dog, please take it inside, or atleast give it a collar that fits and use a rope or yard tie instead of a heavy chain to tie her up. I''m sure she''s tired enough with about 4 pups to raise......', '2008-02-25 14:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515330, 650898, 88878, '<td valign="top">AWWWWWW, this looks just like my dog Molly I had when I was little. A yorkie, right? Mine was a yokie shih tzu mix, but she looked just like this! The b&amp;w works really well here</td>', 'AWWWWWW, this looks just like my dog Molly I had when I was little. A yorkie, right? Mine was a yokie shih tzu mix, but she looked just like this! The b&w works really well here', '2008-02-25 14:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
