(4516958, 650743, 65234, '<td valign="top">Hee-hee :-)  Nice tusks.  The pig does not look terribly engaged in the portrait session, but certainly has no problem filling the frame.  I might play with blurring the background some to make the pig stand out even better.</td>', 'Hee-hee :-)  Nice tusks.  The pig does not look terribly engaged in the portrait session, but certainly has no problem filling the frame.  I might play with blurring the background some to make the pig stand out even better.', '2008-02-25 22:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
