(4516971, 650843, 58330, '<td valign="top">It might have been good to see more of the cat''s face and maybe even to have cropped out the bottom to just see the paws resting on the chair back</td>', 'It might have been good to see more of the cat''s face and maybe even to have cropped out the bottom to just see the paws resting on the chair back', '2008-02-25 22:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
