(4517313, 650247, 37252, '<td valign="top">Lovely blue eyes. Perhaps a little bit too shallow DOF. I would have liked to see the ears in focus also.</td>', 'Lovely blue eyes. Perhaps a little bit too shallow DOF. I would have liked to see the ears in focus also.', '2008-02-26 02:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
