(4517320, 650077, 37252, '<td valign="top">Cute idea - just wish the eyes looked like the dog was a bit happier about this trick. Perhaps try holding a favorite treat up at the last moment, or using a key word that gets your friend excited.</td>', 'Cute idea - just wish the eyes looked like the dog was a bit happier about this trick. Perhaps try holding a favorite treat up at the last moment, or using a key word that gets your friend excited.', '2008-02-26 02:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
