(4518707, 648219, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cat and excellent angle of view. Is that a birthmark on her nose? I love the composition.</td>', 'Beautiful cat and excellent angle of view. Is that a birthmark on her nose? I love the composition.', '2008-02-26 16:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4518709, 649907, 31133, '<td valign="top">Haha! I was trying sooooo hard to do exactly this with my dog and a wide-angle lens, but just couldn''t get it right. Glad you got it! I don''t really understand what this cutie is sitting in, but I guess it doesn''t really matter :-) What a face!</td>', 'Haha! I was trying sooooo hard to do exactly this with my dog and a wide-angle lens, but just couldn''t get it right. Glad you got it! I don''t really understand what this cutie is sitting in, but I guess it doesn''t really matter :-) What a face!', '2008-02-26 16:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4518713, 650815, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is one of the best cat portraits I''ve seen. The lighting on his face is exquisite. And such a good expression.</td>', 'Wow. This is one of the best cat portraits I''ve seen. The lighting on his face is exquisite. And such a good expression.', '2008-02-26 16:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4518723, 650749, 31133, '<td valign="top">I don''t know that I''d like having a chicken (or is it a rooster) as a pet, but I sure would like to be your pet if you can make a portrait as nice as this, haha. It''s an excellent portrait.</td>', 'I don''t know that I''d like having a chicken (or is it a rooster) as a pet, but I sure would like to be your pet if you can make a portrait as nice as this, haha. It''s an excellent portrait.', '2008-02-26 16:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4518729, 650625, 31133, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a wee bit oversharpened, but beautiful!! Just look at those eyes. Nice composition and colors.</td>', 'Perhaps a wee bit oversharpened, but beautiful!! Just look at those eyes. Nice composition and colors.', '2008-02-26 16:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4518737, 650458, 31133, '<td valign="top">Hahaa! Love that look of disdain. What a cutie.</td>', 'Hahaa! Love that look of disdain. What a cutie.', '2008-02-26 16:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
