(4518745, 650115, 31133, '<td valign="top">Love that look out of the corner of the eye! Not sure about the soft focus (it makes me dizzy looking too long at it), but I like the portrait in general very much.</td>', 'Love that look out of the corner of the eye! Not sure about the soft focus (it makes me dizzy looking too long at it), but I like the portrait in general very much.', '2008-02-26 16:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
