(4518764, 649002, 31133, '<td valign="top">She''s straight out of a story book. There are soooo many great pictures in this challenge, but so far (71 of 261 voted), this is my favorite. It''s the eyes that get to me the most. Very nice pose and composition. She looks like a very sweet dog.</td>', 'She''s straight out of a story book. There are soooo many great pictures in this challenge, but so far (71 of 261 voted), this is my favorite. It''s the eyes that get to me the most. Very nice pose and composition. She looks like a very sweet dog.', '2008-02-26 17:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4518770, 649910, 31133, '<td valign="top">It looks like she''s saying "what are YOU looking at?" :-)</td>', 'It looks like she''s saying "what are YOU looking at?" :-)', '2008-02-26 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
