(4518988, 649279, 87328, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF, I love the face! Only Thing I would have done differently would have been to use the color channels a bit more to make the horse stand out a little more than the background, but great picture, My highest rated for this challenge!</td>', 'Excellent DOF, I love the face! Only Thing I would have done differently would have been to use the color channels a bit more to make the horse stand out a little more than the background, but great picture, My highest rated for this challenge!', '2008-02-26 17:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
