(4519610, 650259, 65234, '<td valign="top">The patterns in the eye are rather fascinating.  Like some sort of fancy embroidery stitch.  Like the detail; think a bit more DOF would have gotten the whole head.  Compositionally the eye ended up in the top middle; I would play with some different crops and angles to get it closer to a ROT intersection, but that''s me.  Still a striking shot.</td>', 'The patterns in the eye are rather fascinating.  Like some sort of fancy embroidery stitch.  Like the detail; think a bit more DOF would have gotten the whole head.  Compositionally the eye ended up in the top middle; I would play with some different crops and angles to get it closer to a ROT intersection, but that''s me.  Still a striking shot.', '2008-02-26 22:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519612, 650900, 65234, '<td valign="top">What an adorable scruffy little face :-)  I''d like to see his(?) eyes a little more clearly (maybe dodge to lighten a little and bring out the catchlights and roundness).</td>', 'What an adorable scruffy little face :-)  I''d like to see his(?) eyes a little more clearly (maybe dodge to lighten a little and bring out the catchlights and roundness).', '2008-02-26 22:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
