(4520689, 650749, 65234, '<td valign="top">A nice example of color on color and a good-looking bird.  Nice detail and lighting overall, though missing detail in the shadowed part of the bird.  Not sure what I think of the crop; it seems a little off to have part of the legs but no feet and the crop going through the body and wing somewhat randomly.</td>', 'A nice example of color on color and a good-looking bird.  Nice detail and lighting overall, though missing detail in the shadowed part of the bird.  Not sure what I think of the crop; it seems a little off to have part of the legs but no feet and the crop going through the body and wing somewhat randomly.', '2008-02-27 08:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520695, 649647, 65234, '<td valign="top">He looks so gentle and dignified.  This is a really nice image, perfectly lit.</td>', 'He looks so gentle and dignified.  This is a really nice image, perfectly lit.', '2008-02-27 08:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520696, 650691, 82815, '<td valign="top">I think it''s those eyes, I went back and bumped this to a 8.  I like it</td>', 'I think it''s those eyes, I went back and bumped this to a 8.  I like it', '2008-02-27 08:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520706, 648902, 65234, '<td valign="top">Penni does not look happy about posing.  Pitiful is more like it; I do hope she got a treat afterwards.  White balance looks a little blue to me and the fur looks a little washed out colorwise.</td>', 'Penni does not look happy about posing.  Pitiful is more like it; I do hope she got a treat afterwards.  White balance looks a little blue to me and the fur looks a little washed out colorwise.', '2008-02-27 08:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520715, 649621, 65234, '<td valign="top">Another "awww" shot!  I don''t generally like so much negative space but in this case it serves to better show how itsy bitsy the Doxie is.  Pose is cute and those eyes could melt anyone''s heart :-)</td>', 'Another "awww" shot!  I don''t generally like so much negative space but in this case it serves to better show how itsy bitsy the Doxie is.  Pose is cute and those eyes could melt anyone''s heart :-)', '2008-02-27 08:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520721, 650803, 65234, '<td valign="top">A baby squirrel isn''t enough?  You have to include an adorable, giggling child?  That''s just ... too cute for words, is what it is.</td>', 'A baby squirrel isn''t enough?  You have to include an adorable, giggling child?  That''s just ... too cute for words, is what it is.', '2008-02-27 08:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520726, 650755, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ah, that''s the life alright :-)  Happily playing in the snow.  I think this kind of portrait makes a much better memory than a studio shot ever could.</td>', 'Ah, that''s the life alright :-)  Happily playing in the snow.  I think this kind of portrait makes a much better memory than a studio shot ever could.', '2008-02-27 08:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520744, 649628, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a little cutie!  I love photographing guinea pigs because other than moving their heads a bit to look at you from another angle they pretty much sit still.  And they''re adorable, IMO.  I think I''d prefer a background that wasn''t so overwhelmingly bright with her more subtle coloration, but still a nice shot.</td>', 'What a little cutie!  I love photographing guinea pigs because other than moving their heads a bit to look at you from another angle they pretty much sit still.  And they''re adorable, IMO.  I think I''d prefer a background that wasn''t so overwhelmingly bright with her more subtle coloration, but still a nice shot.', '2008-02-27 08:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520751, 650704, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow; that''s a lot of detail for a fish photo.  Serious gold on the body.</td>', 'Wow; that''s a lot of detail for a fish photo.  Serious gold on the body.', '2008-02-27 08:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520763, 650810, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely softness to this, and the background nicely echoes the blue eye.  Lighting is very nice.  I would crop a bit tighter on the bottom where the chest falls away, or smooth down the sort of ruff under the chin so there''s a smoother line to the body.</td>', 'Lovely softness to this, and the background nicely echoes the blue eye.  Lighting is very nice.  I would crop a bit tighter on the bottom where the chest falls away, or smooth down the sort of ruff under the chin so there''s a smoother line to the body.', '2008-02-27 08:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520765, 648219, 65234, '<td valign="top">I love the expression.  Sort of half annoyed, half curious.  Very fun setup and persepctive.</td>', 'I love the expression.  Sort of half annoyed, half curious.  Very fun setup and persepctive.', '2008-02-27 08:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520850, 650077, 87808, '<td valign="top">Oh you just know that this is going to ribbon.  Fabulous composure from the model, oh and the photographer did a great job too 10<br/> <br/>Charlie just saw this and a HUGE beaming smile came across his face, he says 10 too.  So that makes it 20  Great JOB</td>', 'Oh you just know that this is going to ribbon.  Fabulous composure from the model, oh and the photographer did a great job too 10 Charlie just saw this and a HUGE beaming smile came across his face, he says 10 too.  So that makes it 20  Great JOB', '2008-02-27 09:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520853, 650749, 87808, '<td valign="top">oh gosh, how adorable is your model.  his calm composure and elegant pose, whilst still looking interesting and have emotion in the eyes is outstanding.  Oh and the photographer is pretty good too 10</td>', 'oh gosh, how adorable is your model.  his calm composure and elegant pose, whilst still looking interesting and have emotion in the eyes is outstanding.  Oh and the photographer is pretty good too 10', '2008-02-27 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520854, 650562, 87808, '<td valign="top">love it! love the dog smears of nose prints and paw prints on the glass, the slight outline of the dog is spot on.  Fabulous, well done 10</td>', 'love it! love the dog smears of nose prints and paw prints on the glass, the slight outline of the dog is spot on.  Fabulous, well done 10', '2008-02-27 09:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520855, 650419, 87808, '<td valign="top">OKay, this has to be the cutest on here, bar a few others.  I love the fact you choose the snow as a background, it really makes him pop. His whole persona is sharp, crisp, and clean, you have really brought out the true colours here.  You can sense the trust in his eyes, and I actually like his collar, it makes him less showdog and more of a well loved pet.  great job 10</td>', 'OKay, this has to be the cutest on here, bar a few others.  I love the fact you choose the snow as a background, it really makes him pop. His whole persona is sharp, crisp, and clean, you have really brought out the true colours here.  You can sense the trust in his eyes, and I actually like his collar, it makes him less showdog and more of a well loved pet.  great job 10', '2008-02-27 09:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
