(4520888, 648661, 87808, '<td valign="top">I actually love this shot, the fact that you where able to shoot through glass, speaks volumns. That is seriously one sad looking fish.  The way that you pretty much only have the eyes in focus is a good thing.  But seriously, you need to clean the tank! 10</td>', 'I actually love this shot, the fact that you where able to shoot through glass, speaks volumns. That is seriously one sad looking fish.  The way that you pretty much only have the eyes in focus is a good thing.  But seriously, you need to clean the tank! 10', '2008-02-27 09:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520890, 650328, 87808, '<td valign="top">excellent shot (Irish Wolf Hound???)  the white background really makes him pop off the page, the balcks and whites are not over blown, nice and sharp fur.  Well done 10</td>', 'excellent shot (Irish Wolf Hound???)  the white background really makes him pop off the page, the balcks and whites are not over blown, nice and sharp fur.  Well done 10', '2008-02-27 09:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520891, 648295, 87808, '<td valign="top">Very clever title, i love this shot so much, the details are so clear, teh colours pop so well.  The sharpness is not overdone, you can feel the concentration coming from this 10</td>', 'Very clever title, i love this shot so much, the details are so clear, teh colours pop so well.  The sharpness is not overdone, you can feel the concentration coming from this 10', '2008-02-27 09:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520893, 650565, 87808, '<td valign="top">what a sweetie you have here, she looks ready to go and sae the world.  The left may be a little blown out bt I think that could have more to do with all her whiteness on her breast.  Good Job 9</td>', 'what a sweetie you have here, she looks ready to go and sae the world.  The left may be a little blown out bt I think that could have more to do with all her whiteness on her breast.  Good Job 9', '2008-02-27 09:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520894, 650764, 87808, '<td valign="top">The first time I saw this, I thought it was way overblown, but now I have gone back to and studied it, I like it, would be a 10 but I do think that her right ear could be a little more shadowed. 9  great job well done</td>', 'The first time I saw this, I thought it was way overblown, but now I have gone back to and studied it, I like it, would be a 10 but I do think that her right ear could be a little more shadowed. 9  great job well done', '2008-02-27 09:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520895, 649907, 87808, '<td valign="top">You have succesfully made this look like the adverts for the dogs with big heads.  Normally I cringe when I see them, but for this shot it works so well.  The chair gives you HUGE DOF, the whiteness works so well in different shade of white, great job 9</td>', 'You have succesfully made this look like the adverts for the dogs with big heads.  Normally I cringe when I see them, but for this shot it works so well.  The chair gives you HUGE DOF, the whiteness works so well in different shade of white, great job 9', '2008-02-27 09:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520898, 649968, 87808, '<td valign="top">You are soooooooooo bad for having this in the challenge.  If I could stop actually saying ''arrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr how cute'' I may be able to say something. <br/> <br/>Nope still saying it. <br/> <br/>OKay, now my kids are saying it too and saying you deserve a 10. <br/> <br/>SO I had better justify it, I like the colours, they are deep and rich even though he is a blonde.  The curly fuy on the ears contrasts nicely with the rest of the fur and being slightly different makes it pop out of the page. The water drops, highlighted bring another dimension to the shot.  It is sharp in all the right places but still soft enough to grab your attention.</td>', 'You are soooooooooo bad for having this in the challenge.  If I could stop actually saying ''arrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr how cute'' I may be able to say something.  Nope still saying it.  OKay, now my kids are saying it too and saying you deserve a 10.  SO I had better justify it, I like the colours, they are deep and rich even though he is a blonde.  The curly fuy on the ears contrasts nicely with the rest of the fur and being slightly different makes it pop out of the page. The water drops, highlighted bring another dimension to the shot.  It is sharp in all the right places but still soft enough to grab your attention.', '2008-02-27 09:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520899, 649830, 87808, '<td valign="top">oh gosh, how adorable is your model.  his calm composure and elegant pose, whilst still looking interesting and have emotion in the eyes is outstanding.  Oh and the photographer is pretty good too 9</td>', 'oh gosh, how adorable is your model.  his calm composure and elegant pose, whilst still looking interesting and have emotion in the eyes is outstanding.  Oh and the photographer is pretty good too 9', '2008-02-27 09:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
