(4520901, 650491, 87808, '<td valign="top">Your title adds a point on, you read the title and your heart strings are tugged.  Her feathers are clean cut, sharp, and you can almost belive that is bashfullness in her eyes!  well done 9</td>', 'Your title adds a point on, you read the title and your heart strings are tugged.  Her feathers are clean cut, sharp, and you can almost belive that is bashfullness in her eyes!  well done 9', '2008-02-27 09:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520902, 650817, 87808, '<td valign="top">Its all in the eyes, and you have captured it right at the right moment.  S/He is not loking alert, or sleepy or tired, you have seemed to have got the look of wiseness and knowledge.  The ears seem to want to rubbed , the sharp details are there. Would be a 10 bar the tip of the nose seems a little out of focus.</td>', 'Its all in the eyes, and you have captured it right at the right moment.  S/He is not loking alert, or sleepy or tired, you have seemed to have got the look of wiseness and knowledge.  The ears seem to want to rubbed , the sharp details are there. Would be a 10 bar the tip of the nose seems a little out of focus.', '2008-02-27 09:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
