(4521746, 650457, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition with the top of the head and ears just at the edge of the frame.  If only this was a little bit sharper...the eyes are just a tad soft for a portrait IMO.  Getting a blue cast also from the outdoor shaded light.  A minor tweak with color temp would warm that up.<br/> <br/>Overall, a well composed image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the composition with the top of the head and ears just at the edge of the frame.  If only this was a little bit sharper...the eyes are just a tad soft for a portrait IMO.  Getting a blue cast also from the outdoor shaded light.  A minor tweak with color temp would warm that up. Overall, a well composed image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-02-27 12:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4521748, 650077, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Bet you''ve heard that a few times, eh?  :-)  The concept is quite clever and overall well executed.  Something about the lighting...it''s almost too controlled and gives a slightly flat appearance to this photo.  Did you "dry" the dogs mouth and nose via post-processing?  They seem unusually dull (non shiny) and dry.  Last thing (sorry, feels like I''m pickin on you - don''t mean too)...the dogs left eye (the viewers right) looks like the reflection was tamped down a little causing it to look fuzzy (non sharp).<br/> <br/>I like this photo (really!).  Is it possible to have something <u>too</u> perfect?<br/> <br/>All of this is JMO of course, and regardless, I think you''ll be scoring quite high with it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute!  Bet you''ve heard that a few times, eh?  :-)  The concept is quite clever and overall well executed.  Something about the lighting...it''s almost too controlled and gives a slightly flat appearance to this photo.  Did you "dry" the dogs mouth and nose via post-processing?  They seem unusually dull (non shiny) and dry.  Last thing (sorry, feels like I''m pickin on you - don''t mean too)...the dogs left eye (the viewers right) looks like the reflection was tamped down a little causing it to look fuzzy (non sharp). I like this photo (really!).  Is it possible to have something too perfect? All of this is JMO of course, and regardless, I think you''ll be scoring quite high with it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2008-02-27 12:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4521768, 650563, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh, I hope this one does well.  It''s a stunning portrait.  The fireplace background is a wonderful touch!  Darn cats are so hard to handle...if only his/her ears were focused forward this would be perfect.  Well done!</td>', 'Oh, I hope this one does well.  It''s a stunning portrait.  The fireplace background is a wonderful touch!  Darn cats are so hard to handle...if only his/her ears were focused forward this would be perfect.  Well done!', '2008-02-27 12:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4521851, 649287, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter shot, bringing the face into full frame would have really set those eyes.</td>', 'I think a tighter shot, bringing the face into full frame would have really set those eyes.', '2008-02-27 12:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522222, 650827, 63244, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful kitty.  Love the DOF chosen and your colors are great!</td>', 'What a beautiful kitty.  Love the DOF chosen and your colors are great!', '2008-02-27 13:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522250, 650656, 63244, '<td valign="top">DNMC - for those that have had this experience (and all to recently), I personally find this in poor tast even though I know it was meant in fun.</td>', 'DNMC - for those that have had this experience (and all to recently), I personally find this in poor tast even though I know it was meant in fun.', '2008-02-27 14:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522263, 650835, 63244, '<td valign="top">ok, this is obviously a shoehorn shot, but in much better taste than the other.  Pretty cute actually.</td>', 'ok, this is obviously a shoehorn shot, but in much better taste than the other.  Pretty cute actually.', '2008-02-27 14:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522266, 650835, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious!  I want one of those pets too - it''s cute.</td>', 'This is hilarious!  I want one of those pets too - it''s cute.', '2008-02-27 14:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522268, 650795, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love how the focus starts with the big beautiful eyes and then everything kind of fades away.  Nice color tone choice too.</td>', 'I love how the focus starts with the big beautiful eyes and then everything kind of fades away.  Nice color tone choice too.', '2008-02-27 14:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522270, 650749, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the rich, golden brown tone of this picture.  Beautiful capture of all the layers of feathers.</td>', 'I love the rich, golden brown tone of this picture.  Beautiful capture of all the layers of feathers.', '2008-02-27 14:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522272, 650457, 63244, '<td valign="top">Love the little freckles!</td>', 'Love the little freckles!', '2008-02-27 14:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522274, 650077, 67697, '<td valign="top">I bet this one is fun to feed. :)  This is such a cute photo!  You must have gotten it done right away - no slobber! lol</td>', 'I bet this one is fun to feed. :)  This is such a cute photo!  You must have gotten it done right away - no slobber! lol', '2008-02-27 14:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522275, 650558, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is sooo cute!  I love the diagonal capture and the centered subject.  Who can resist a face like that?</td>', 'This is sooo cute!  I love the diagonal capture and the centered subject.  Who can resist a face like that?', '2008-02-27 14:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522276, 650202, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is so cool.  I feel like I am looking at a furry person.  Those eyes and face and pose are just wonderful.  It looks like he''s ready to tell you a little story.</td>', 'This is so cool.  I feel like I am looking at a furry person.  Those eyes and face and pose are just wonderful.  It looks like he''s ready to tell you a little story.', '2008-02-27 14:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522282, 649382, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beagles rule.  Need I say more?  You are lucky she sat for you.  Mine is tired of me and my camera lol.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beagles rule.  Need I say more?  You are lucky she sat for you.  Mine is tired of me and my camera lol.  Good luck!', '2008-02-27 14:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522285, 650710, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wow the eyes really jump out at you.  I love how they quickly engage you and pull you into the photo.  Very nice.</td>', 'Wow the eyes really jump out at you.  I love how they quickly engage you and pull you into the photo.  Very nice.', '2008-02-27 14:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522293, 650701, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love the title. This is a very good dog portrait with the tongue and the scarf. Might like to see a bit less dof to keep the eye squarely on this fine dog though.</td>', 'I love the title. This is a very good dog portrait with the tongue and the scarf. Might like to see a bit less dof to keep the eye squarely on this fine dog though.', '2008-02-27 14:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522295, 650851, 67697, '<td valign="top">Lots of beagles!  Beagles rule :)  I know they can be a pain to photograph since they do not want to sit still.  I wish this one was looking more towards the camera to get a better glimpse of the eyes.  Or at least crop some of the dead space on the left to bring more focus to all of the beag.</td>', 'Lots of beagles!  Beagles rule :)  I know they can be a pain to photograph since they do not want to sit still.  I wish this one was looking more towards the camera to get a better glimpse of the eyes.  Or at least crop some of the dead space on the left to bring more focus to all of the beag.', '2008-02-27 14:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522300, 650359, 67697, '<td valign="top">You are truly a master to be able to get all of these guys to sit and pose nicely for you like this.  Cute photo!</td>', 'You are truly a master to be able to get all of these guys to sit and pose nicely for you like this.  Cute photo!', '2008-02-27 14:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522302, 650467, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ah, there his is hiding in the back row! Great idea, but I think it could''ve gone over better with just one color background and a matching "floor." The reason for this is that all the stuffed animals add a lot of complexity to the image, so it''s not that helpful to have additional complexity in the background and foreground. The dog is very, very cute!</td>', 'Ah, there his is hiding in the back row! Great idea, but I think it could''ve gone over better with just one color background and a matching "floor." The reason for this is that all the stuffed animals add a lot of complexity to the image, so it''s not that helpful to have additional complexity in the background and foreground. The dog is very, very cute!', '2008-02-27 14:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522305, 650868, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve caught all the beagle pics now.  This one looks like it''s been swimming!  Mine hates the water lol.  I love the beagle reflection in the water.  Beagles rule!  :)</td>', 'I think I''ve caught all the beagle pics now.  This one looks like it''s been swimming!  Mine hates the water lol.  I love the beagle reflection in the water.  Beagles rule!  :)', '2008-02-27 14:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522308, 650801, 67697, '<td valign="top">Those are the funkiest looking eyes - almost look human!  This photo just makes me laugh - what a hilarious expression!</td>', 'Those are the funkiest looking eyes - almost look human!  This photo just makes me laugh - what a hilarious expression!', '2008-02-27 14:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522313, 650820, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Full of life.</td>', 'Beautiful! Full of life.', '2008-02-27 14:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522316, 650307, 66952, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful job lighting a black dog. This is *so* hard to get right, and you''ve done an amazing job.</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful job lighting a black dog. This is *so* hard to get right, and you''ve done an amazing job.', '2008-02-27 14:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522340, 649621, 90263, '<td valign="top">nice color!</td>', 'nice color!', '2008-02-27 14:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522355, 650751, 31133, '<td valign="top">At first glance, it looked like there''s too much Neat Image or something smoothing out the hairs on your cat. But I love the way he''s looking at the camera, and now that I look more, the more I like the image. So I can only say, good job :-)</td>', 'At first glance, it looked like there''s too much Neat Image or something smoothing out the hairs on your cat. But I love the way he''s looking at the camera, and now that I look more, the more I like the image. So I can only say, good job :-)', '2008-02-27 14:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522359, 650579, 67258, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is Stephen, or a Whiterook tribute, but either way, I the humour is great, and a welcome relief from furry cuteness!  I also like that I share my name with the gull :¬)</td>', 'Not sure if this is Stephen, or a Whiterook tribute, but either way, I the humour is great, and a welcome relief from furry cuteness!  I also like that I share my name with the gull :¬)', '2008-02-27 14:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522361, 650467, 67258, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment or two to find the imposter!  Novel idea that works well, and gave me a smile.</td>', 'Took me a moment or two to find the imposter!  Novel idea that works well, and gave me a smile.', '2008-02-27 14:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522362, 649296, 31133, '<td valign="top">The high contrast and green eyes are a bit much for my taste. I think the black background is a good idea, but the light looks harsh. It''s a cute dog though ... love those ears!</td>', 'The high contrast and green eyes are a bit much for my taste. I think the black background is a good idea, but the light looks harsh. It''s a cute dog though ... love those ears!', '2008-02-27 14:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522490, 650847, 8367, '<td valign="top">Gotta love it! Wonderful tones on this unique capture. Well done!</td>', 'Gotta love it! Wonderful tones on this unique capture. Well done!', '2008-02-27 15:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522495, 650597, 8367, '<td valign="top">A beauty...great capture!</td>', 'A beauty...great capture!', '2008-02-27 15:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522498, 650820, 8367, '<td valign="top">Love the ears. Beautiful tones, beautiful dog.</td>', 'Love the ears. Beautiful tones, beautiful dog.', '2008-02-27 15:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522501, 649253, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hopefully he doesn''t chase trains!  Sweet looking dog - the color scheme of the background matches him nicely.</td>', 'Hopefully he doesn''t chase trains!  Sweet looking dog - the color scheme of the background matches him nicely.', '2008-02-27 15:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522506, 650755, 30982, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  A very "dog" dog shot.  Nice!</td>', 'Adorable!  A very "dog" dog shot.  Nice!', '2008-02-27 15:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522508, 650365, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the old fashioned feel of this - this could be a picture found in Grandma''s shoebox in the attic.</td>', 'I really like the old fashioned feel of this - this could be a picture found in Grandma''s shoebox in the attic.', '2008-02-27 15:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522512, 650409, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, high key works very well for his elegant feline!</td>', 'Ah, high key works very well for his elegant feline!', '2008-02-27 15:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522513, 650738, 30982, '<td valign="top">Always nice to have assistants help out with photoshoots!</td>', 'Always nice to have assistants help out with photoshoots!', '2008-02-27 15:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522515, 650233, 30982, '<td valign="top">He''s very well behaved - posed very well for you!  May not be much fun to cuddle with, but he''s a looker!</td>', 'He''s very well behaved - posed very well for you!  May not be much fun to cuddle with, but he''s a looker!', '2008-02-27 15:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522521, 649005, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a marvelous idea and excellent execution!</td>', 'What a marvelous idea and excellent execution!', '2008-02-27 15:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522525, 650739, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect pose - shows off her regal and assured composure.</td>', 'Perfect pose - shows off her regal and assured composure.', '2008-02-27 15:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522529, 648782, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the high key and the "fill in the details on your own" aspect of the brightly lit side.  Having tried this in a previous challenge, I hope you''re scoring better with it!</td>', 'I like the high key and the "fill in the details on your own" aspect of the brightly lit side.  Having tried this in a previous challenge, I hope you''re scoring better with it!', '2008-02-27 15:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522530, 650225, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the way you chose to light to emphasize the "morning" aspect of this shot.  Shows off the personality well.</td>', 'I like the way you chose to light to emphasize the "morning" aspect of this shot.  Shows off the personality well.', '2008-02-27 15:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522531, 650893, 30982, '<td valign="top">Aww, that''s the sweetest face.  I love the different shaped eyes.</td>', 'Aww, that''s the sweetest face.  I love the different shaped eyes.', '2008-02-27 15:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522535, 650896, 30982, '<td valign="top">Frank is a beautiful animal and you did very well to get such great detail in the black.</td>', 'Frank is a beautiful animal and you did very well to get such great detail in the black.', '2008-02-27 15:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522540, 650858, 30982, '<td valign="top">Boomer definitely has a presence!!  I like the pose you chose - shows off his stoic nature very well.  The shot does have a lot of grain to it which may be hurting your score.</td>', 'Boomer definitely has a presence!!  I like the pose you chose - shows off his stoic nature very well.  The shot does have a lot of grain to it which may be hurting your score.', '2008-02-27 15:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522542, 650587, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sophie has lovely eyelashes.  I always wonder how these dogs see.  Nice choice of color to show off the silver of the fur.</td>', 'Sophie has lovely eyelashes.  I always wonder how these dogs see.  Nice choice of color to show off the silver of the fur.', '2008-02-27 15:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522547, 649002, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, she has you totally wrapped around her paw, doesn''t she?  This look tells me so!</td>', 'Oh, she has you totally wrapped around her paw, doesn''t she?  This look tells me so!', '2008-02-27 15:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522609, 650896, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit and composed. It''s hard to get the texture of the black fur to show up so nicely.</td>', 'Beautifully lit and composed. It''s hard to get the texture of the black fur to show up so nicely.', '2008-02-27 16:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522616, 650701, 66952, '<td valign="top">A lovely, simple portrait of a really sweet looking dog.</td>', 'A lovely, simple portrait of a really sweet looking dog.', '2008-02-27 16:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522618, 650801, 66952, '<td valign="top">I love it! I laugh every time I look at this one. The expression is priceless!</td>', 'I love it! I laugh every time I look at this one. The expression is priceless!', '2008-02-27 16:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522619, 650893, 66952, '<td valign="top">Great job getting the detail in the cat''s fur. The high key background may be a little ''too'' high key, but still, good job capturing the cat''s personality.</td>', 'Great job getting the detail in the cat''s fur. The high key background may be a little ''too'' high key, but still, good job capturing the cat''s personality.', '2008-02-27 16:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522623, 650283, 66952, '<td valign="top">Lively and fun! I''ve been trying to get a good head-on shot of my dog for months, and have not succeeded yet. Great job!</td>', 'Lively and fun! I''ve been trying to get a good head-on shot of my dog for months, and have not succeeded yet. Great job!', '2008-02-27 16:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522624, 650347, 30982, '<td valign="top">Paisley looks very proper and composed.  I bet she has a sweet personality!</td>', 'Paisley looks very proper and composed.  I bet she has a sweet personality!', '2008-02-27 16:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522626, 650786, 66952, '<td valign="top">A very sweet looking kitty. Great job with the soft light and DOF.</td>', 'A very sweet looking kitty. Great job with the soft light and DOF.', '2008-02-27 16:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522627, 650127, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how the natural light really brings out the color in the fur.  A beautifully marked feline.</td>', 'I like how the natural light really brings out the color in the fur.  A beautifully marked feline.', '2008-02-27 16:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522628, 648295, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of turtle zen!  Really quite a lovely shot - great detail in the face and the front legs.</td>', 'Excellent capture of turtle zen!  Really quite a lovely shot - great detail in the face and the front legs.', '2008-02-27 16:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522629, 650441, 66952, '<td valign="top">Elegant. Not much more to say, really. The horse looks beautiful.</td>', 'Elegant. Not much more to say, really. The horse looks beautiful.', '2008-02-27 16:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522630, 650822, 30982, '<td valign="top">Charlie is much loved and well cared for - as evidenced by his tag in case he gets lost.  He also looks quite proud and I love the ears!</td>', 'Charlie is much loved and well cared for - as evidenced by his tag in case he gets lost.  He also looks quite proud and I love the ears!', '2008-02-27 16:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522631, 650803, 30982, '<td valign="top">How very cute!  Very well executed.  Do you really have a pet squirrel?  I guess you must - can''t see doing this with a wild one!</td>', 'How very cute!  Very well executed.  Do you really have a pet squirrel?  I guess you must - can''t see doing this with a wild one!', '2008-02-27 16:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522632, 650668, 30982, '<td valign="top">He looks so serious!  And like he''s concentrating VERY hard on being a good subject for his photograph.</td>', 'He looks so serious!  And like he''s concentrating VERY hard on being a good subject for his photograph.', '2008-02-27 16:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522633, 650324, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love the title!  Really adds a nice touch to the shot.  This feels very alive - I can almost see the cat breathing.</td>', 'LOL!  Love the title!  Really adds a nice touch to the shot.  This feels very alive - I can almost see the cat breathing.', '2008-02-27 16:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522636, 650827, 30982, '<td valign="top">Aww, that is one sweet cat.  Excellent pose, colors, and background for this.</td>', 'Aww, that is one sweet cat.  Excellent pose, colors, and background for this.', '2008-02-27 16:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522651, 649248, 66952, '<td valign="top">Awwwww....Beautiful pose and lighting. A very sweet shot.</td>', 'Awwwww....Beautiful pose and lighting. A very sweet shot.', '2008-02-27 16:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522654, 650815, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus and lighting control. Beautiful cat, too.</td>', 'Beautiful focus and lighting control. Beautiful cat, too.', '2008-02-27 16:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522656, 650742, 66952, '<td valign="top">Fun! One of my faves in the challenge.</td>', 'Fun! One of my faves in the challenge.', '2008-02-27 16:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
