(4523939, 650010, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a solemn cat.  Maybe just a tiny bit annoyed.  I do like those "eyebrows."  White balance looks a little pink on my screen.</td>', 'Looks like a solemn cat.  Maybe just a tiny bit annoyed.  I do like those "eyebrows."  White balance looks a little pink on my screen.', '2008-02-27 23:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523940, 650441, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely horse and nice job on the exposure.</td>', 'Lovely horse and nice job on the exposure.', '2008-02-27 23:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523943, 648355, 65234, '<td valign="top">She looks highly pettable with those soft ears and folds of skin on her face.  Background is a little busy; I might''ve blurred it some or used a shallower DOF.</td>', 'She looks highly pettable with those soft ears and folds of skin on her face.  Background is a little busy; I might''ve blurred it some or used a shallower DOF.', '2008-02-27 23:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523981, 650467, 60698, '<td valign="top">Creative and cute! Love the pose!</td>', 'Creative and cute! Love the pose!', '2008-02-27 23:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524072, 649382, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice pose. The eyes look a little soft and I''m not a fan of the white background</td>', 'Nice pose. The eyes look a little soft and I''m not a fan of the white background', '2008-02-28 00:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524078, 649621, 89940, '<td valign="top">The B/W works well. The right ear looks funny, looks like there is a tag or something hanging off it. I also find the reflections in the eyes to be distracting.</td>', 'The B/W works well. The right ear looks funny, looks like there is a tag or something hanging off it. I also find the reflections in the eyes to be distracting.', '2008-02-28 00:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524088, 650893, 31535, '<td valign="top">I think a different colour background would have been better. The white makes your cat look too yellow.</td>', 'I think a different colour background would have been better. The white makes your cat look too yellow.', '2008-02-28 01:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524090, 650652, 31535, '<td valign="top">Cute photo. I think you cropped it a little too tight at his backside.</td>', 'Cute photo. I think you cropped it a little too tight at his backside.', '2008-02-28 01:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524092, 650736, 31535, '<td valign="top">I love the processing. Her expression just shouts "Give me a treat"</td>', 'I love the processing. Her expression just shouts "Give me a treat"', '2008-02-28 01:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524095, 650307, 31535, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous dog. You lighting is great because it really brings out the texture in his/her fur. I hope you post your setup.</td>', 'Gorgeous dog. You lighting is great because it really brings out the texture in his/her fur. I hope you post your setup.', '2008-02-28 01:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524096, 649830, 31535, '<td valign="top">Cats fill the frame alot better than dogs. In this case, you''ve done a great job.</td>', 'Cats fill the frame alot better than dogs. In this case, you''ve done a great job.', '2008-02-28 01:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524101, 650077, 31535, '<td valign="top">lol. Very cute.</td>', 'lol. Very cute.', '2008-02-28 01:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524102, 650660, 31535, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the processing. Good on you though for trying something different.</td>', 'I''m not fond of the processing. Good on you though for trying something different.', '2008-02-28 01:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524106, 648782, 31535, '<td valign="top">The aliens have landed. jk :) Quite overexposed, but im sure it was on purpose.</td>', 'The aliens have landed. jk :) Quite overexposed, but im sure it was on purpose.', '2008-02-28 01:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524108, 650509, 31535, '<td valign="top">A little fill flash would help this shot alot. I can barely see his eyes.</td>', 'A little fill flash would help this shot alot. I can barely see his eyes.', '2008-02-28 01:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524109, 649279, 31535, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is a huge smile. Great capture</td>', 'Wow, that is a huge smile. Great capture', '2008-02-28 01:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524110, 650460, 31535, '<td valign="top">An adorable dog. Too bad you had a chin in the background.</td>', 'An adorable dog. Too bad you had a chin in the background.', '2008-02-28 01:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524111, 649968, 31535, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Puppies always give you the best looks.</td>', 'Very cute. Puppies always give you the best looks.', '2008-02-28 01:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524112, 650240, 31535, '<td valign="top">A little soft on the focus. Very cute anyways.</td>', 'A little soft on the focus. Very cute anyways.', '2008-02-28 01:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524115, 650359, 31535, '<td valign="top">You must have had a treat.</td>', 'You must have had a treat.', '2008-02-28 01:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524120, 650634, 31535, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve managed to keep the eyes and snout in focus. Also, the expression if great.</td>', 'I like that you''ve managed to keep the eyes and snout in focus. Also, the expression if great.', '2008-02-28 01:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524122, 650736, 89940, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the eye are very distracting.</td>', 'The reflections in the eye are very distracting.', '2008-02-28 01:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524123, 650307, 89940, '<td valign="top">The top light is a little harsh but I really like the way it shows the shape and texture of the fur</td>', 'The top light is a little harsh but I really like the way it shows the shape and texture of the fur', '2008-02-28 01:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524124, 650454, 31535, '<td valign="top">Adorable</td>', 'Adorable', '2008-02-28 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524125, 650692, 89940, '<td valign="top">Way too underexposed, I could hardly tell there was a cat there.</td>', 'Way too underexposed, I could hardly tell there was a cat there.', '2008-02-28 01:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524127, 650797, 31535, '<td valign="top">Great photo. B&amp;W, the tones, and the shallow DOF work really well. The barrel distortion stood out as soon as I looked at this though. Could be fixed in PS. 8</td>', 'Great photo. B&W, the tones, and the shallow DOF work really well. The barrel distortion stood out as soon as I looked at this though. Could be fixed in PS. 8', '2008-02-28 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524131, 650787, 89940, '<td valign="top">I like the snow a lot. I like the fur that is in the sunlight wish the left eye was not so deep in shadow.</td>', 'I like the snow a lot. I like the fur that is in the sunlight wish the left eye was not so deep in shadow.', '2008-02-28 01:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524200, 650242, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely pose and the background suits this nicely.  She looks very elegant and sophisticated.</td>', 'A lovely pose and the background suits this nicely.  She looks very elegant and sophisticated.', '2008-02-28 04:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524201, 650481, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cute and a great way to present this delicate little pet!</td>', 'Very cute and a great way to present this delicate little pet!', '2008-02-28 04:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524202, 650565, 30982, '<td valign="top">A well presented classic pose - and a very pretty dog!</td>', 'A well presented classic pose - and a very pretty dog!', '2008-02-28 04:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524204, 649277, 30982, '<td valign="top">Somehow the soft and limited light here really adds a lot to this for me.</td>', 'Somehow the soft and limited light here really adds a lot to this for me.', '2008-02-28 04:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524205, 649404, 30982, '<td valign="top">He looks like he knows it, too - that he''s the best dog ever.  He looks like he takes that job very seriously and with a lot of heart.</td>', 'He looks like he knows it, too - that he''s the best dog ever.  He looks like he takes that job very seriously and with a lot of heart.', '2008-02-28 04:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524206, 650820, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.', '2008-02-28 04:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524237, 650558, 19912, '<td valign="top">adorable!</td>', 'adorable!', '2008-02-28 05:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524239, 650077, 19912, '<td valign="top">:-)))</td>', ':-)))', '2008-02-28 05:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524347, 650506, 65811, '<td valign="top">What a cool looking cat!  I love it''s markings.  I would have brightened the image just a little, to bring out some of the textures.</td>', 'What a cool looking cat!  I love it''s markings.  I would have brightened the image just a little, to bring out some of the textures.', '2008-02-28 07:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524349, 650094, 65811, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop and angle, nice textures, and the eye is nice and clear too</td>', 'Interesting crop and angle, nice textures, and the eye is nice and clear too', '2008-02-28 07:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524350, 650851, 65811, '<td valign="top">Pretty puppy dog, I find the background washes him/her out a little.</td>', 'Pretty puppy dog, I find the background washes him/her out a little.', '2008-02-28 07:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524354, 650443, 65811, '<td valign="top">Lovely pose.  Very cute/cool looking kitty!  I like the white dot on the whiskers, so cute.  Nice saturation, the eyes standout perfectly.</td>', 'Lovely pose.  Very cute/cool looking kitty!  I like the white dot on the whiskers, so cute.  Nice saturation, the eyes standout perfectly.', '2008-02-28 07:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524356, 650286, 65811, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture in the fur.  Pity the light was so strong in the background, it takes away from the cool-looking fur.</td>', 'Very nice texture in the fur.  Pity the light was so strong in the background, it takes away from the cool-looking fur.', '2008-02-28 07:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524360, 650243, 65811, '<td valign="top">Hmm, that''s a chicken in the basket?  LOL  Odd couple, very cute.  I like the angle that this was taken with.</td>', 'Hmm, that''s a chicken in the basket?  LOL  Odd couple, very cute.  I like the angle that this was taken with.', '2008-02-28 07:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524361, 649970, 65811, '<td valign="top">It sure does look like a hummingbird at a quick glance!  I can''t figure out what kind of fish this is, no matter how long I look.  Platy?  Goldfish?  Very cool angle.... it makes you look.</td>', 'It sure does look like a hummingbird at a quick glance!  I can''t figure out what kind of fish this is, no matter how long I look.  Platy?  Goldfish?  Very cool angle.... it makes you look.', '2008-02-28 07:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524364, 650543, 65811, '<td valign="top">Hmm, Havana Brown?  Delicious looking cat, beautiful eyes, nice lighting, excellent clarity.</td>', 'Hmm, Havana Brown?  Delicious looking cat, beautiful eyes, nice lighting, excellent clarity.', '2008-02-28 07:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524365, 650712, 65811, '<td valign="top">That''s one sweet, cuddly doggie!  Lovely portrait</td>', 'That''s one sweet, cuddly doggie!  Lovely portrait', '2008-02-28 07:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524366, 650633, 65811, '<td valign="top">Haha I get a kick out of the snow-covered nose :P.  The coloring reminds me of a Prezwalski''s Horse.  Nice pose, great lighting.</td>', 'Haha I get a kick out of the snow-covered nose :P.  The coloring reminds me of a Prezwalski''s Horse.  Nice pose, great lighting.', '2008-02-28 07:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524368, 648384, 65811, '<td valign="top">Heh, I hope the dog had a breath mint beforehand :P.  Nice take on the challenge</td>', 'Heh, I hope the dog had a breath mint beforehand :P.  Nice take on the challenge', '2008-02-28 07:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524369, 650414, 65811, '<td valign="top">Excellent pose, nice crop -- the lighting could have been better though.  Probably wasn''t easy to get kitty to sit like that, and look where you wanted it too.</td>', 'Excellent pose, nice crop -- the lighting could have been better though.  Probably wasn''t easy to get kitty to sit like that, and look where you wanted it too.', '2008-02-28 07:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524371, 650704, 65811, '<td valign="top">Those scales look like molten gold!  Awesome looking fish, excellent clarity and sharpness... just beautiful</td>', 'Those scales look like molten gold!  Awesome looking fish, excellent clarity and sharpness... just beautiful', '2008-02-28 07:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524376, 650597, 65811, '<td valign="top">Blue-point Siamese?  Those azure blue eyes are gorgeous.  The background compliments this kitty purr-fectly (I know, bad pun)</td>', 'Blue-point Siamese?  Those azure blue eyes are gorgeous.  The background compliments this kitty purr-fectly (I know, bad pun)', '2008-02-28 07:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524379, 649404, 65811, '<td valign="top">Pretty Lab, s/he has a sweet face!</td>', 'Pretty Lab, s/he has a sweet face!', '2008-02-28 07:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524380, 650259, 65811, '<td valign="top">Ah, here''s our ribbon winner.  Nothing to say, this picture can''t be improved and there''s nothing bad about it.  Perfection.</td>', 'Ah, here''s our ribbon winner.  Nothing to say, this picture can''t be improved and there''s nothing bad about it.  Perfection.', '2008-02-28 07:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524383, 649382, 65811, '<td valign="top">Awe, she really is smiling!  What a cute puppy.  I find that the white background detracts from the nice lines that the dog has.</td>', 'Awe, she really is smiling!  What a cute puppy.  I find that the white background detracts from the nice lines that the dog has.', '2008-02-28 07:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524384, 650338, 65811, '<td valign="top">Haha, I love it!  Excellent angle, the variation in shapes really gets your attention.</td>', 'Haha, I love it!  Excellent angle, the variation in shapes really gets your attention.', '2008-02-28 07:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524386, 650233, 65811, '<td valign="top">Nice to see something a little "out of the box" in a pet challenge.  Nice DOF, looks like you have a nice tank set-up as well.  For a catfish, this is pretty cool.</td>', 'Nice to see something a little "out of the box" in a pet challenge.  Nice DOF, looks like you have a nice tank set-up as well.  For a catfish, this is pretty cool.', '2008-02-28 07:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524390, 650793, 65811, '<td valign="top">Excellent expression on the dog''s face, nice lighting.  I like how the eye is focused, whereas the rest of the dog appears to be in motion (or about to be)</td>', 'Excellent expression on the dog''s face, nice lighting.  I like how the eye is focused, whereas the rest of the dog appears to be in motion (or about to be)', '2008-02-28 07:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524391, 650895, 65811, '<td valign="top">Nice representation of a cat :P.  I get the same exasperated look from my cats, followed by a heavy sigh.</td>', 'Nice representation of a cat :P.  I get the same exasperated look from my cats, followed by a heavy sigh.', '2008-02-28 07:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524393, 650548, 65811, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, the eyes are good and clear.  He''s so black that he just fades away into the background!</td>', 'Nice pose, the eyes are good and clear.  He''s so black that he just fades away into the background!', '2008-02-28 07:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524396, 650565, 65811, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking dog.  Lighting is excellent, really textures in the fur, great pose; almost looks like she''s smiling!</td>', 'Very cool looking dog.  Lighting is excellent, really textures in the fur, great pose; almost looks like she''s smiling!', '2008-02-28 07:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524398, 650743, 65811, '<td valign="top">Goodness!  A pot-bellied pig!  Always nice to see a different kind of pet.  Lighting seems a little harsh, but it''s got some great texture and detail.</td>', 'Goodness!  A pot-bellied pig!  Always nice to see a different kind of pet.  Lighting seems a little harsh, but it''s got some great texture and detail.', '2008-02-28 07:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524401, 650446, 65811, '<td valign="top">Nice textures, I really like the expression.  Lovely eyes.</td>', 'Nice textures, I really like the expression.  Lovely eyes.', '2008-02-28 07:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524404, 650457, 65811, '<td valign="top">Very nice crop, totally cute puppy!</td>', 'Very nice crop, totally cute puppy!', '2008-02-28 07:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524408, 649277, 65811, '<td valign="top">Dramatic lighting, I like how the dog is emerging from the darkness</td>', 'Dramatic lighting, I like how the dog is emerging from the darkness', '2008-02-28 07:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524410, 648355, 69722, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture. And I love that eye. Her age is showing in the grey, isn''t it? She''s gorgeous.</td>', 'Lovely texture. And I love that eye. Her age is showing in the grey, isn''t it? She''s gorgeous.', '2008-02-28 07:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524411, 650684, 65811, '<td valign="top">LOL  Nice title :P.  I like the angle of the cat''s face.  It reminds me of those "Cool Cats" series pictures.</td>', 'LOL  Nice title :P.  I like the angle of the cat''s face.  It reminds me of those "Cool Cats" series pictures.', '2008-02-28 07:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524412, 650831, 69722, '<td valign="top">And I can almost see you in her (his?) eyes.</td>', 'And I can almost see you in her (his?) eyes.', '2008-02-28 07:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524415, 650767, 65811, '<td valign="top">My what luxurious, red fur you have!  I bet this dog is just gorgeous, sparkling in the sunlight.</td>', 'My what luxurious, red fur you have!  I bet this dog is just gorgeous, sparkling in the sunlight.', '2008-02-28 07:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524416, 649970, 69722, '<td valign="top">Ha! Looks like Fred is wiggling his tail in the excitement of the meeting.</td>', 'Ha! Looks like Fred is wiggling his tail in the excitement of the meeting.', '2008-02-28 07:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524417, 650202, 69722, '<td valign="top">Wally''s personality is showing. Nice. 7</td>', 'Wally''s personality is showing. Nice. 7', '2008-02-28 07:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524418, 649974, 65811, '<td valign="top">LOL  Very cozy looking picture, my cats would never allow this to be taken :P.  He''s a good sport I see.  Nice composition, though the background is busy it''s also complementary.</td>', 'LOL  Very cozy looking picture, my cats would never allow this to be taken :P.  He''s a good sport I see.  Nice composition, though the background is busy it''s also complementary.', '2008-02-28 07:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524422, 649296, 65811, '<td valign="top">Amazing how the eyes match the color of the scarf!  Nice textures</td>', 'Amazing how the eyes match the color of the scarf!  Nice textures', '2008-02-28 07:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524423, 650010, 69722, '<td valign="top">Amazing how the kitten in them still shows!</td>', 'Amazing how the kitten in them still shows!', '2008-02-28 08:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524425, 650558, 65811, '<td valign="top">LOL  Nicely done.  DOF is great, cool angle, clarity on the nose is great.  And the expression is priceless!</td>', 'LOL  Nicely done.  DOF is great, cool angle, clarity on the nose is great.  And the expression is priceless!', '2008-02-28 08:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524427, 648416, 65811, '<td valign="top">Oooo, look at those eyes!  Beautiful.  Purr-fect focus, great DOF, nice lighting, excellent pose and expression.</td>', 'Oooo, look at those eyes!  Beautiful.  Purr-fect focus, great DOF, nice lighting, excellent pose and expression.', '2008-02-28 08:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524430, 650075, 65811, '<td valign="top">This putty-tat looks so soft and cuddly.  Such a comfortable looking pose.</td>', 'This putty-tat looks so soft and cuddly.  Such a comfortable looking pose.', '2008-02-28 08:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524433, 650239, 65811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, that pose is fantastic!  This has GOT to be a ribbon winner.  Perfect lighting, great colors, texture and focus are spot-on.  Awesome.</td>', 'Wonderful, that pose is fantastic!  This has GOT to be a ribbon winner.  Perfect lighting, great colors, texture and focus are spot-on.  Awesome.', '2008-02-28 08:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524435, 650584, 65811, '<td valign="top">LMAO  Wow, you gotta be quick to get a picture like that!  Great shot, not your typical cat picture.</td>', 'LMAO  Wow, you gotta be quick to get a picture like that!  Great shot, not your typical cat picture.', '2008-02-28 08:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524436, 649907, 65811, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, it definitely gives a sense of height.  Nice expression on the doggy''s face too.</td>', 'I like the angle, it definitely gives a sense of height.  Nice expression on the doggy''s face too.', '2008-02-28 08:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524438, 648649, 65811, '<td valign="top">Hmm,  I rather like this "air brush" look.  Pretty cool looking dog.  Nice pose, eyes are lovely :).</td>', 'Hmm,  I rather like this "air brush" look.  Pretty cool looking dog.  Nice pose, eyes are lovely :).', '2008-02-28 08:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524456, 649253, 65811, '<td valign="top">I really like how this scene compliments itself:  Nice colors, good lighting, interesting angle, etc.</td>', 'I really like how this scene compliments itself:  Nice colors, good lighting, interesting angle, etc.', '2008-02-28 08:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524476, 650900, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness of the contrast - the light fur against the black.  He looks pensive, almost thoughtful.</td>', 'I like the starkness of the contrast - the light fur against the black.  He looks pensive, almost thoughtful.', '2008-02-28 08:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524477, 650579, 65811, '<td valign="top">Okay, so everyone else is complaining about the graininess.....  Nice minimalistic approach, textures are nice but a little distracting.  I would have tightened the crop just a bit, to put more focus on the seagull.</td>', 'Okay, so everyone else is complaining about the graininess.....  Nice minimalistic approach, textures are nice but a little distracting.  I would have tightened the crop just a bit, to put more focus on the seagull.', '2008-02-28 08:26:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4524478, 649907, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title!!  And a really cute approach to the shot.</td>', 'Wonderful title!!  And a really cute approach to the shot.', '2008-02-28 08:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524485, 648450, 65811, '<td valign="top">Dramatic lighting, very regal expression, nice textured fur</td>', 'Dramatic lighting, very regal expression, nice textured fur', '2008-02-28 08:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524493, 650654, 65811, '<td valign="top">Someone looks a little annoyed :P  Looks like a picture you''d see in the "Cool Cats" series.  I like the saturation used here, nice DOF.</td>', 'Someone looks a little annoyed :P  Looks like a picture you''d see in the "Cool Cats" series.  I like the saturation used here, nice DOF.', '2008-02-28 08:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524501, 648902, 65811, '<td valign="top">Heh, now that''s a forlorn expression.  This is the type of photo that invokes "feeling" to the viewer -- everyone things "awe poor doggie".  Nicely done.</td>', 'Heh, now that''s a forlorn expression.  This is the type of photo that invokes "feeling" to the viewer -- everyone things "awe poor doggie".  Nicely done.', '2008-02-28 08:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524503, 650598, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like your choice of a natural setting for this.  The cat almost looks like he (she?) is on duty as a guard cat, complete with intimidating stare and formal attire.  You do have a bit of blue fringing in places - on the back legs, the chest, the nose.  I''d love to tell you why, but I''m not sure - you should ask after the challenge in a forum thread if you don''t get another comment explaining it.</td>', 'I really like your choice of a natural setting for this.  The cat almost looks like he (she?) is on duty as a guard cat, complete with intimidating stare and formal attire.  You do have a bit of blue fringing in places - on the back legs, the chest, the nose.  I''d love to tell you why, but I''m not sure - you should ask after the challenge in a forum thread if you don''t get another comment explaining it.', '2008-02-28 08:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
