(4528065, 650896, 7473, '<td valign="top">nice clarity in the eyes. i might have ''healed'' some of that dander.</td>', 'nice clarity in the eyes. i might have ''healed'' some of that dander.', '2008-02-29 13:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528071, 650786, 7473, '<td valign="top">was the DOF in camera?  It seems as if there has been an artificial blur around the outside fur of the cat.</td>', 'was the DOF in camera?  It seems as if there has been an artificial blur around the outside fur of the cat.', '2008-02-29 13:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528072, 649936, 7473, '<td valign="top">a little blown out unnaturally in post process?</td>', 'a little blown out unnaturally in post process?', '2008-02-29 13:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528073, 650464, 7473, '<td valign="top">nice bokea and color contrast.</td>', 'nice bokea and color contrast.', '2008-02-29 13:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528086, 650247, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty eyes and nice, soft light.  The crop makes kitty look a little tubby (which might or might not refect reality).</td>', 'Pretty eyes and nice, soft light.  The crop makes kitty look a little tubby (which might or might not refect reality).', '2008-02-29 14:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528089, 648887, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute pooch; love the wild hair.  Background is a bit noisy.</td>', 'Cute pooch; love the wild hair.  Background is a bit noisy.', '2008-02-29 14:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528094, 649830, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous eyes, wonderful softness in the fur.  Perfect use of a centered composition.</td>', 'Gorgeous eyes, wonderful softness in the fur.  Perfect use of a centered composition.', '2008-02-29 14:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528095, 648384, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!!  What are pets without their people?</td>', 'Wonderful!!  What are pets without their people?', '2008-02-29 14:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528096, 650641, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent shot of what looks to be a very wonderful dog.  Print this, frame it, and hang it.</td>', 'An excellent shot of what looks to be a very wonderful dog.  Print this, frame it, and hang it.', '2008-02-29 14:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528097, 650797, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love this - very well done.</td>', 'I love this - very well done.', '2008-02-29 14:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528098, 650833, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Very telling of the dog and his place.  I love how his eyes match the porch.  Nice use of wide angle!</td>', 'Wonderful!  Very telling of the dog and his place.  I love how his eyes match the porch.  Nice use of wide angle!', '2008-02-29 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528099, 650245, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dynamic pose and nice capture of the light.  Ordinarily I don''t care for a lot of blown light but in this case it doesn''t bother me.  I think the repetition of the rectangular shapes of the window, frame, and wall make it seem more an integral part of the scene than a distraction.</td>', 'Dynamic pose and nice capture of the light.  Ordinarily I don''t care for a lot of blown light but in this case it doesn''t bother me.  I think the repetition of the rectangular shapes of the window, frame, and wall make it seem more an integral part of the scene than a distraction.', '2008-02-29 14:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528100, 650433, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Essense of cat.</td>', 'Excellent.  Essense of cat.', '2008-02-29 14:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528101, 650202, 30982, '<td valign="top">He looks very wise, very confident.  Reminds me of a portrait of someone''s grandfather for some reason.  Love the light, the pose, the setting - all very good.</td>', 'He looks very wise, very confident.  Reminds me of a portrait of someone''s grandfather for some reason.  Love the light, the pose, the setting - all very good.', '2008-02-29 14:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528102, 650715, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful and poignant shot to me.  The chain, the puppies, the look from the dog.  She lives the life she has.  The correlation to the people who own her is probably more direct than most would wish to consider.</td>', 'This is a very powerful and poignant shot to me.  The chain, the puppies, the look from the dog.  She lives the life she has.  The correlation to the people who own her is probably more direct than most would wish to consider.', '2008-02-29 14:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528103, 650535, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic lighting, indeeed.  Fun approach to the subject.</td>', 'Very dramatic lighting, indeeed.  Fun approach to the subject.', '2008-02-29 14:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528104, 650847, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh, this is priceless.  Obviously this is a cat who has been bathed before or you couldn''t have taken this shot and lived to tell about it.</td>', 'Oh my gosh, this is priceless.  Obviously this is a cat who has been bathed before or you couldn''t have taken this shot and lived to tell about it.', '2008-02-29 14:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528108, 649324, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice drip of drool on the tongue, there ;-)  Background is still a bit busy even though OOF; I''d try a slightly higher angle so the horizontal of the fence didn''t show and get Cash to look up at the camera.</td>', 'Very nice drip of drool on the tongue, there ;-)  Background is still a bit busy even though OOF; I''d try a slightly higher angle so the horizontal of the fence didn''t show and get Cash to look up at the camera.', '2008-02-29 14:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528112, 650457, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aww; cute pup.  Not sure I like the very tight crop on top only; also, his/her eyes need wiping (pet peeve of mine; can''t help noticing).</td>', 'Aww; cute pup.  Not sure I like the very tight crop on top only; also, his/her eyes need wiping (pet peeve of mine; can''t help noticing).', '2008-02-29 14:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528113, 650537, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent closeup portrait and the frame you chose presents it very well.</td>', 'An excellent closeup portrait and the frame you chose presents it very well.', '2008-02-29 14:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528114, 650246, 30982, '<td valign="top">Mesmerizing eyes!!</td>', 'Mesmerizing eyes!!', '2008-02-29 14:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528116, 650641, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice smile on Bailey.  I think I''d crop this even tighter; Bailey''s neither centered nor on ROT.</td>', 'Very nice smile on Bailey.  I think I''d crop this even tighter; Bailey''s neither centered nor on ROT.', '2008-02-29 14:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528118, 650460, 65234, '<td valign="top">Adorable little face.  Much busyness in the background (I think Gino was warming someone''s lap); B&amp;W helps mitigate that.</td>', 'Adorable little face.  Much busyness in the background (I think Gino was warming someone''s lap); B&W helps mitigate that.', '2008-02-29 14:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528121, 650820, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the head turn implied by the ears, and the wagon makes a nice background without being distracting.  Tones are nice; I would dodge the catchlights a bit more for emphasis.</td>', 'I like the head turn implied by the ears, and the wagon makes a nice background without being distracting.  Tones are nice; I would dodge the catchlights a bit more for emphasis.', '2008-02-29 14:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528123, 650097, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent light, great tones, and wonderful use of the bag for framing.</td>', 'Excellent light, great tones, and wonderful use of the bag for framing.', '2008-02-29 14:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528124, 650795, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent cat portrait - love those big round eyes!  Toning suits this very well.</td>', 'Excellent cat portrait - love those big round eyes!  Toning suits this very well.', '2008-02-29 14:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528125, 650677, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice balance to the composition, though the snake is just a small part of it.  If you caught him/her with tongue sticking out that would have bumped this into a whole ''nother level of wonderfulness, but it''s pretty good as is.</td>', 'Nice balance to the composition, though the snake is just a small part of it.  If you caught him/her with tongue sticking out that would have bumped this into a whole ''nother level of wonderfulness, but it''s pretty good as is.', '2008-02-29 14:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528141, 650768, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s wonderful. Love the play of light and shadow.  Great ears.  Papillon mix? I keep coming back to this guy.  What a charmer.  Upping the score too. ;~)</td>', 'That''s wonderful. Love the play of light and shadow.  Great ears.  Papillon mix? I keep coming back to this guy.  What a charmer.  Upping the score too. ;~)', '2008-02-29 14:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528190, 650656, 70896, '<td valign="top">That''s... sad, to say the least! Sorry for your loss?</td>', 'That''s... sad, to say the least! Sorry for your loss?', '2008-02-29 15:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528191, 649722, 70896, '<td valign="top">Very cute dog, but the quality of the picture is not good.</td>', 'Very cute dog, but the quality of the picture is not good.', '2008-02-29 15:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528195, 649963, 70896, '<td valign="top">I get the photo, but I dont understand the chip clip on his head. It''s a bit too bright for me, and I''m not a big fan of the color. Funny idea though!</td>', 'I get the photo, but I dont understand the chip clip on his head. It''s a bit too bright for me, and I''m not a big fan of the color. Funny idea though!', '2008-02-29 15:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528197, 650664, 70896, '<td valign="top">The cat is OOF. Tongue is funny!</td>', 'The cat is OOF. Tongue is funny!', '2008-02-29 15:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528201, 649296, 70896, '<td valign="top">He looks like he''s possesed because of the eyes!! The light is not my favorite, I think not using a frontal flash would have been a lot better.</td>', 'He looks like he''s possesed because of the eyes!! The light is not my favorite, I think not using a frontal flash would have been a lot better.', '2008-02-29 15:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528204, 650659, 70896, '<td valign="top">The lighting is not really good. Maybe use softer light next time.</td>', 'The lighting is not really good. Maybe use softer light next time.', '2008-02-29 15:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528224, 650755, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Aww.  I bet this gives you such a smile.  Very nice moment capture.</td>', '7 - Aww.  I bet this gives you such a smile.  Very nice moment capture.', '2008-02-29 15:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528225, 649404, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice pose captured.  ''If only'' the light in his right eye the same as his left, but difficult.  Perhaps a more refined crop at the bottom just above his hind leg, maybe losing the collar too and this bigger - 720, give this a lot more impact.  Lighting is nice showing the sheen in his coat.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Nice pose captured.  ''If only'' the light in his right eye the same as his left, but difficult.  Perhaps a more refined crop at the bottom just above his hind leg, maybe losing the collar too and this bigger - 720, give this a lot more impact.  Lighting is nice showing the sheen in his coat.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2008-02-29 15:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528227, 650691, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Oh, it''s so easy when they''re this beautiful.  Excellent focus.  Like the ''in synch'' reflections and the gray background.  I wonder about a variation in the crop/composition, but your call.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Oh, it''s so easy when they''re this beautiful.  Excellent focus.  Like the ''in synch'' reflections and the gray background.  I wonder about a variation in the crop/composition, but your call.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2008-02-29 15:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
