(4528258, 649830, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - I deliberated over this at first, it <i>is</i> good, but my first thoughts were that the eyes were overprocessed to the point that they didn''t look natural, that coupled with the few similar images I''ve seen on DPC, although that really doesn''t matter.  There <i>is</i> something slightly unnatural in the eyes, but could be that this is shot in a studio, not sure, but - other than perhaps a suggestion of the lighting at the top similar to that as what appears to be at the bottom, this is a very good image and a very nice pet portrait, and yes, shows off the ''plain old tabby cat''''s features well.</td>', '8 - I deliberated over this at first, it is good, but my first thoughts were that the eyes were overprocessed to the point that they didn''t look natural, that coupled with the few similar images I''ve seen on DPC, although that really doesn''t matter.  There is something slightly unnatural in the eyes, but could be that this is shot in a studio, not sure, but - other than perhaps a suggestion of the lighting at the top similar to that as what appears to be at the bottom, this is a very good image and a very nice pet portrait, and yes, shows off the ''plain old tabby cat''''s features well.', '2008-02-29 15:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
