(4528936, 650665, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute dogs, but I''m not sure the harsh light, angle, and DOF are showing them off to best effect.</td>', 'Cute dogs, but I''m not sure the harsh light, angle, and DOF are showing them off to best effect.', '2008-02-29 23:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528937, 650891, 51597, '<td valign="top">Dangerfield is a handsome fellow.. BG enhances.. Very sharp image.. well done..</td>', 'Dangerfield is a handsome fellow.. BG enhances.. Very sharp image.. well done..', '2008-02-29 23:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528938, 649296, 65234, '<td valign="top">The scarf is a cute idea, but the green pupils are tough to look at.  If you did that on purpose I''m not sure it''s the most flattering look for the dog; if you didn''t do it on purpose I recommend bouncing your flash or diffusing it, and if you still get green pupils desaturate them to a greyer color and then burn them to look realistic.</td>', 'The scarf is a cute idea, but the green pupils are tough to look at.  If you did that on purpose I''m not sure it''s the most flattering look for the dog; if you didn''t do it on purpose I recommend bouncing your flash or diffusing it, and if you still get green pupils desaturate them to a greyer color and then burn them to look realistic.', '2008-02-29 23:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528939, 650858, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pensive fellow.  A couple of suggestions: clean the dog''s eyes before taking the picture or clone out the goobers in post-processing, and maybe don''t push the contrast so far (don''t know if that was in the exposure or processing), and make sure the eyes are in sharp focus for a portrait (most viewers will expect that).  Not a big fan of the noise; it just doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'Looks like a pensive fellow.  A couple of suggestions: clean the dog''s eyes before taking the picture or clone out the goobers in post-processing, and maybe don''t push the contrast so far (don''t know if that was in the exposure or processing), and make sure the eyes are in sharp focus for a portrait (most viewers will expect that).  Not a big fan of the noise; it just doesn''t appeal to me.', '2008-02-29 23:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528940, 650817, 51597, '<td valign="top">Wow wouldn''t of guessed this dog is older.. Soft sweet wonderful image..</td>', 'Wow wouldn''t of guessed this dog is older.. Soft sweet wonderful image..', '2008-02-29 23:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
