(4531524, 649722, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pretty much a snapshot here, I''m afraid. Cute pup, though. <br/> <br/>Your file size is only 39k when you could have used up to 200k for this challenge. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is surely taking a lot of detail out of your photo. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over. Some Post processing adjustment of curves would have helped give this some depth and bring out some details. Hope this all helps.</td>', 'Pretty much a snapshot here, I''m afraid. Cute pup, though.  Your file size is only 39k when you could have used up to 200k for this challenge. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is surely taking a lot of detail out of your photo. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over. Some Post processing adjustment of curves would have helped give this some depth and bring out some details. Hope this all helps.', '2008-03-01 21:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531526, 650883, 40370, '<td valign="top">Wow, the shine on that fur is amazing ... and the eyes ... tug at the heart strings love !! Can''t help but imagine a bit more neutral backdrop would compliment this beautiful pup.</td>', 'Wow, the shine on that fur is amazing ... and the eyes ... tug at the heart strings love !! Can''t help but imagine a bit more neutral backdrop would compliment this beautiful pup.', '2008-03-01 21:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
