(4531529, 650734, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good, but I think cropping to put the dog on the left of the frame would have improved the composition. That way he would be looking into the frame instead of out of it and the viewers eye would be led the same way.</td>', 'Good, but I think cropping to put the dog on the left of the frame would have improved the composition. That way he would be looking into the frame instead of out of it and the viewers eye would be led the same way.', '2008-03-01 21:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
