(4531687, 650077, 17203, '<td valign="top">Well right there it is... incontrovertible proof of evolution! I''m not loving the background, and the eyes are kinda dull, but this model will not be denied a great portrait. 9</td>', 'Well right there it is... incontrovertible proof of evolution! I''m not loving the background, and the eyes are kinda dull, but this model will not be denied a great portrait. 9', '2008-03-01 23:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
