(4531832, 648414, 83313, '<td valign="top">Rightmost bunny is a little too much in shadows, and the middle guy looks a little odd with one eye hidden, but  otherwise a good effort. The one on the far left is just right.</td>', 'Rightmost bunny is a little too much in shadows, and the middle guy looks a little odd with one eye hidden, but  otherwise a good effort. The one on the far left is just right.', '2008-03-02 01:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
