(4533890, 650847, 79021, '<td valign="top">This is one of the two pictures that I think definitely deserves a ribbon.  The processing fits the mood and expression on the cat.  Overall, this is just a perfect shot in terms of composition, processing, and a really good subject.  Well done.  The only thing I am not crazy about is the title, but that''s not really important.</td>', 'This is one of the two pictures that I think definitely deserves a ribbon.  The processing fits the mood and expression on the cat.  Overall, this is just a perfect shot in terms of composition, processing, and a really good subject.  Well done.  The only thing I am not crazy about is the title, but that''s not really important.', '2008-03-02 23:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
