(4534398, 650460, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lisa<br/> <br/>Lovely pet portrait.  Superb clarity on the face and I like the DOF that you used which accentuates the snout.  As ever a great B&amp;W conversion<br/> <br/>Its a shame that your friend had to hold the dog as it does make the background a little busy, but this is just a very minor point on what is a superb image</td>', 'Lisa Lovely pet portrait.  Superb clarity on the face and I like the DOF that you used which accentuates the snout.  As ever a great B&W conversion Its a shame that your friend had to hold the dog as it does make the background a little busy, but this is just a very minor point on what is a superb image', '2008-03-03 04:18:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4534402, 650634, 68035, '<td valign="top">Michelle<br/> <br/>I KNEW that of all the beagle portaits in the challenge this one would be yours.<br/> <br/>I thought this was a fantastic portait (it got a 7 from me).  Superb sharpness, great dof lovely composition and a great title (that matched the image)<br/> <br/>Without a doubt my favourite of all the beagle shots that you have taken<br/> <br/>wonderful<br/> <br/>Jon</td>', 'Michelle I KNEW that of all the beagle portaits in the challenge this one would be yours. I thought this was a fantastic portait (it got a 7 from me).  Superb sharpness, great dof lovely composition and a great title (that matched the image) Without a doubt my favourite of all the beagle shots that you have taken wonderful Jon', '2008-03-03 04:22:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4534405, 649002, 68035, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the top ten finish.<br/> <br/>A real ''classic'' pet portrait that I could imagine sitting in the front window of a photography studio for passers by to see and admire<br/> <br/>Very clever composition and the low key really helps to accentuate the strength of colours in Milly Grace''s fur.  Added to which there is a softness that seems empathetic with the personality of the dof<br/> <br/>As usual focus and dof bang on to the millimeter<br/> <br/>Great job</td>', 'Congratulations on the top ten finish. A real ''classic'' pet portrait that I could imagine sitting in the front window of a photography studio for passers by to see and admire Very clever composition and the low key really helps to accentuate the strength of colours in Milly Grace''s fur.  Added to which there is a softness that seems empathetic with the personality of the dof As usual focus and dof bang on to the millimeter Great job', '2008-03-03 04:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
