(4534803, 650847, 39850, '<td valign="top"><i>"... This cat has his moments. I actually had to train him to just stand there but for the most part he kind of does it on his own. He knows he can''t get out of the bathroom while the door is shut but the second the door is open he bolts out and slides right by you. I shot this on a tripod with my handy dandy remote in my hands. I had to keep dumping water on him because he kept shaking it off... "</i> - some cats <i>do</i> like to play in water, does this cat get in the tub naturally? <i>edit: thank you for the clarification pm</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-03 10:24:34.</i></td>', '"... This cat has his moments. I actually had to train him to just stand there but for the most part he kind of does it on his own. He knows he can''t get out of the bathroom while the door is shut but the second the door is open he bolts out and slides right by you. I shot this on a tripod with my handy dandy remote in my hands. I had to keep dumping water on him because he kept shaking it off... " - some cats do like to play in water, does this cat get in the tub naturally? edit: thank you for the clarification pm', '2008-03-03 09:55:51.000000', '2008-03-03 10:24:34.000000', 0),
