(4535305, 650793, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is very striking, Kelli.  You''ve caught a kind sad, shy, vulnerable look on a dog - not an easy thing to do.  The one thing I''m not quite fond of is the color of the blanket - it doesn''t compliment the dog''s color well, but I don''t know how to fix that easily either!</td>', 'This is very striking, Kelli.  You''ve caught a kind sad, shy, vulnerable look on a dog - not an easy thing to do.  The one thing I''m not quite fond of is the color of the blanket - it doesn''t compliment the dog''s color well, but I don''t know how to fix that easily either!', '2008-03-03 13:03:05.000000', NULL, 0),
