(4535314, 650864, 30982, '<td valign="top">I didn''t comment.  Hmmm.  This is one I quite liked, but I guess I ran out of gas in the commenting department.  If you shot in RAW, there''s a trick you can try in lens adjustment for the fringing if you care to do so.  I''ve been watching Photoshop videos on the internet....  Hasn''t helped me much other than learning new words like "chromic abberation" which would probably be fun to use in a poem.</td>', 'I didn''t comment.  Hmmm.  This is one I quite liked, but I guess I ran out of gas in the commenting department.  If you shot in RAW, there''s a trick you can try in lens adjustment for the fringing if you care to do so.  I''ve been watching Photoshop videos on the internet....  Hasn''t helped me much other than learning new words like "chromic abberation" which would probably be fun to use in a poem.', '2008-03-03 13:05:43.000000', NULL, 0),
