(4535324, 650679, 30982, '<td valign="top">Actually, I did like this one because of the "dog''s world" viewpoint of it.  In a perfect world there would be a bit more light in his/her eyes.  But it''s definitely very much "dog".  And the nose doesn''t need to be in focus for me - works quite well the way it is.</td>', 'Actually, I did like this one because of the "dog''s world" viewpoint of it.  In a perfect world there would be a bit more light in his/her eyes.  But it''s definitely very much "dog".  And the nose doesn''t need to be in focus for me - works quite well the way it is.', '2008-03-03 13:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
