(4535553, 649505, 69684, '<td valign="top">She looks so sweet. The eyes are just adorable. The background fits very well with Zoe (wasn''t it?), but (just trying to give some positive criticism and it''s always easier to say than to do), I think this would have scored a lot better without the brown background. Just the whites as background would be wonderful here. Have a nice holiday soon, I''m just jealous :-)</td>', 'She looks so sweet. The eyes are just adorable. The background fits very well with Zoe (wasn''t it?), but (just trying to give some positive criticism and it''s always easier to say than to do), I think this would have scored a lot better without the brown background. Just the whites as background would be wonderful here. Have a nice holiday soon, I''m just jealous :-)', '2008-03-03 14:22:14.000000', NULL, 0),
