(4535985, 649830, 83165, '<td valign="top">Wow! Just fantastic! How did you get this damn sharpness in the eyes :D I have tried for a year to get such a nice shoot of my cat and I m still searching for a good approach to do this...this is the best cat foto i ve ever seen ;)<br/> <br/>(sorry for my bad english, i have learnt it for two years only)</td>', 'Wow! Just fantastic! How did you get this damn sharpness in the eyes :D I have tried for a year to get such a nice shoot of my cat and I m still searching for a good approach to do this...this is the best cat foto i ve ever seen ;) (sorry for my bad english, i have learnt it for two years only)', '2008-03-03 16:59:48.000000', NULL, 0),
