(4536007, 648315, 81669, '<td valign="top">(Thanks, Skip!) I appreciate those comments that "got" what I was trying to do with this! One FAVORITE, even!! Thank you!!!<br/> <br/>(As for the "poor lighting and focus" comment -- sometimes these lighting and focus efffects are, duh, <i>intentional</i>. Try... whoa... scribbling <i>outside the box </i>once in a while! Hey! It''s fun!! Wow!!! Effects! Freedoom!! Creative Expression!!!)<br/> <br/>But, that''s okay. Man. I''m here to LEARN too, and we''re ALL on a learning curve, right? I just think the newbies ought to learn a little more before presuming to be so critical. I''m not really so concerened with scores, though, as much as trying out different ideas. So... whatever. But I try not to criticize others'' efforts at creativity. If''n I don''t "like" an entry, I choose not to score it or to comment. Easy. Peace and Love! (And... yes, "Pisces Rising is a very good sign.") <b>HAVE FUN!!!</b></td>', '(Thanks, Skip!) I appreciate those comments that "got" what I was trying to do with this! One FAVORITE, even!! Thank you!!! (As for the "poor lighting and focus" comment -- sometimes these lighting and focus efffects are, duh, intentional. Try... whoa... scribbling outside the box once in a while! Hey! It''s fun!! Wow!!! Effects! Freedoom!! Creative Expression!!!) But, that''s okay. Man. I''m here to LEARN too, and we''re ALL on a learning curve, right? I just think the newbies ought to learn a little more before presuming to be so critical. I''m not really so concerened with scores, though, as much as trying out different ideas. So... whatever. But I try not to criticize others'' efforts at creativity. If''n I don''t "like" an entry, I choose not to score it or to comment. Easy. Peace and Love! (And... yes, "Pisces Rising is a very good sign.") HAVE FUN!!!', '2008-03-03 17:15:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4536038, 649287, 77192, '<td valign="top">Shame it was DQed but I can see why. She''s a beautiful dog :-)</td>', 'Shame it was DQed but I can see why. She''s a beautiful dog :-)', '2008-03-03 17:34:57.000000', NULL, 0),
