(4536065, 648661, 63269, '<td valign="top">Completely terrific and WAY under-rated. I love the violently mournful expression on the fish, and the tones are superb. Perhaps it would have scored better if the picture was sharper, more clear. Something about the murkiness appeals to me though. I guess I don''t really like the <i>grain </i>but the blurry dark green weaving througough the photo creates a perfect and fascinating setting.</td>', 'Completely terrific and WAY under-rated. I love the violently mournful expression on the fish, and the tones are superb. Perhaps it would have scored better if the picture was sharper, more clear. Something about the murkiness appeals to me though. I guess I don''t really like the grain but the blurry dark green weaving througough the photo creates a perfect and fascinating setting.', '2008-03-03 17:48:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4536070, 650664, 63269, '<td valign="top">LOL! Don''t you just love it when you catch a cat doing something goofy? They aren''t as perfect as they''d like you to believe... :D</td>', 'LOL! Don''t you just love it when you catch a cat doing something goofy? They aren''t as perfect as they''d like you to believe... :D', '2008-03-03 17:51:47.000000', NULL, 0),
