(4540924, 650715, 39218, '<td valign="top">The saddest part of this picture to me is that the chain is so short that she can''t even comfortably lay down to nurse her pups.  <br/> <br/>It''s an excellent portrait of a mother and her brood, in less than perfect circumstances, yet she seems happy enough to provide nourishment.  It makes me stop long enough to wonder where her water bowl is, and whether someone is feeding her as well.  <br/> <br/>A truly great shot is one that evokes emotion and makes you think.  This does both.</td>', 'The saddest part of this picture to me is that the chain is so short that she can''t even comfortably lay down to nurse her pups.   It''s an excellent portrait of a mother and her brood, in less than perfect circumstances, yet she seems happy enough to provide nourishment.  It makes me stop long enough to wonder where her water bowl is, and whether someone is feeding her as well.   A truly great shot is one that evokes emotion and makes you think.  This does both.', '2008-03-05 13:54:45.000000', NULL, 0),
