(4543247, 650572, 57421, '<td valign="top">comment related to your "pointers to what doesn''t work" question. First, with a 6.94 score, I wouldn''t say it has not worked. My take is that it lacks the high contrast tack sharp details that seem to work better on average here (too "dirty"). But at this stage, I would not change anything, unless your only goal is to collect ribbons. Because this photo is at least worth the ones that ribboned - if not better. - as it is. (for one it is perfectly sharp, imho, where it needs to be, no more).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-06 12:31:49.</i></td>', 'comment related to your "pointers to what doesn''t work" question. First, with a 6.94 score, I wouldn''t say it has not worked. My take is that it lacks the high contrast tack sharp details that seem to work better on average here (too "dirty"). But at this stage, I would not change anything, unless your only goal is to collect ribbons. Because this photo is at least worth the ones that ribboned - if not better. - as it is. (for one it is perfectly sharp, imho, where it needs to be, no more).', '2008-03-06 12:30:23.000000', '2008-03-06 12:31:49.000000', 0),
