(4546430, 650669, 74559, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot! I love her intense and attentive expression, her blowing ear, that curly wet fur... excellent processing too, great tones and looks almost 3D :-)</td>', 'What a beautiful shot! I love her intense and attentive expression, her blowing ear, that curly wet fur... excellent processing too, great tones and looks almost 3D :-)', '2008-03-07 18:15:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4546456, 650572, 61651, '<td valign="top">This does have a lovely emotive quality to it - and I have to laugh after reading your photog comments - now I have an image of her hoisted in the air thinking, "what the...?"  :)</td>', 'This does have a lovely emotive quality to it - and I have to laugh after reading your photog comments - now I have an image of her hoisted in the air thinking, "what the...?"  :)', '2008-03-07 18:24:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4546462, 650835, 61651, '<td valign="top">That shadow is a really nice bonus.  I actually happened to look at another of your Woody shots in your portfolio a day or so before I saw this (holding a duck), and your name briefly crossed my mind.  So count me as one who thought it was you and not Art. :)</td>', 'That shadow is a really nice bonus.  I actually happened to look at another of your Woody shots in your portfolio a day or so before I saw this (holding a duck), and your name briefly crossed my mind.  So count me as one who thought it was you and not Art. :)', '2008-03-07 18:27:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4546465, 650544, 61651, '<td valign="top">I love it - a toilet as a portrait seat!  Those eyes are amazing, and I especially like the repetition of the heart shapes - fantastic shot!</td>', 'I love it - a toilet as a portrait seat!  Those eyes are amazing, and I especially like the repetition of the heart shapes - fantastic shot!', '2008-03-07 18:29:23.000000', NULL, 0),
