(4562492, 649968, 74559, '<td valign="top">I tell you what, when you have photographed such an adorable creature with that sweet tilt of the head (and good cropping kudos to you) in such a great setting (snowflakes on the nose--ahhhh) with great lighting and fantastic detail (again kudos to you for your dof), this is so NOT ''not very creative'' (to quote your original comments). I''m a cat person, but I''d sure take a dog like this thanks to your FANTASTIC portrait. This was within my handful of top votes for this challenge.</td>', 'I tell you what, when you have photographed such an adorable creature with that sweet tilt of the head (and good cropping kudos to you) in such a great setting (snowflakes on the nose--ahhhh) with great lighting and fantastic detail (again kudos to you for your dof), this is so NOT ''not very creative'' (to quote your original comments). I''m a cat person, but I''d sure take a dog like this thanks to your FANTASTIC portrait. This was within my handful of top votes for this challenge.', '2008-03-13 19:17:35.000000', NULL, 0),
